{"about_the_game":"Unique turn-based sandbox strategy fighting game. Inspired by YOMI Hustle, TORIBASH and SPORE. Build your own character, fight AI or duel with friends online!<br>FAS is a game for users who enjoy building, simulating, and casual fighting games with friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN-BASED SANDBOX FIGHTING</strong></h2>Use a wealth of tools to play how you want, and express yourself through the art of combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/3b078158d7f346506c86ddc2a76cac21.poster.avif?t=1682393635\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/3b078158d7f346506c86ddc2a76cac21.webm?t=1682393635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/3b078158d7f346506c86ddc2a76cac21.mp4?t=1682393635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN CHARACTERS</strong></h2>It includes an in-game editor for creating characters, abilities, and particles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/5397e875037a2e5177fa041e5ce31ff6.poster.avif?t=1682393635\" width=600 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/5397e875037a2e5177fa041e5ce31ff6.webm?t=1682393635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/5397e875037a2e5177fa041e5ce31ff6.mp4?t=1682393635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PULVERIZE YOUR FRIENDS ONLINE</strong></h2>You can play multiplayer with your friends.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/1f6952c47865b6600b8e9ee7b6e7396c.poster.avif?t=1682393635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/1f6952c47865b6600b8e9ee7b6e7396c.webm?t=1682393635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/1f6952c47865b6600b8e9ee7b6e7396c.mp4?t=1682393635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE FIGHT SCENES</strong></h2>Save the replay and it will play a cinematic battle video including your own camera moves. Share it with other users through workshops.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEAM WORKSHOP</strong></h2>Characters, abilities, particles, and replays are integrated into the steam workshop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302820/extras/3e41f2d4bf6f5a44a238de14d5b736fb.avif?t=1682393635\" width=600 height=452 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First action win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302820/a079eebb09e7d51b9593cd679c1b34c7fdd77524.jpg"},{"name":"Custom character creator! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302820/50ebb0cfeb017b819d3aa9880f2c15c7aa854c8d.jpg"},{"name":"Custom prop creator!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302820/50ebb0cfeb017b819d3aa9880f2c15c7aa854c8d.jpg"},{"name":"Custom ability creator!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302820/50ebb0cfeb017b819d3aa9880f2c15c7aa854c8d.jpg"},{"name":"Custom particle creator!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2302820/50ebb0cfeb017b819d3aa9880f2c15c7aa854c8d.jpg"},{"name